Bug fix: add missing flag SVG images for language selector buttons.

This commit modifies 5 files (+37 lines), touching 5 other files.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
Language selector buttons were showing white/grey boxes because the
flag images referenced in LanguageSelector.ts did not exist.

Created SVG flag images for all 5 supported languages:
- public/assets/flags/en.svg (UK flag / Union Jack)
- public/assets/flags/es.svg (Spain flag)
- public/assets/flags/fr.svg (France flag / tricolor)
- public/assets/flags/de.svg (Germany flag)
- public/assets/flags/ru.svg (Russia flag)

The code in LanguageSelector.ts already sets backgroundImage to
/assets/flags/{code}.svg — the files just didn't exist. Vite serves
public/ at root so the paths resolve correctly.

Key files: public/assets/flags/de.svg, public/assets/flags/en.svg, public/assets/flags/es.svg, public/assets/flags/fr.svg, public/assets/flags/ru.svg.
